Beta Versions

1.1.0
-Panopto caption source detection: results now record whether captions are
 auto-generated (ASR) or human-edited, with a confidence level and the signals
 behind the verdict
-YouTube results report caption source too, using YouTube's own metadata
-Rebuilt GUI: non-blocking audits with a live activity log, progress bar and a
 Stop button; sortable/filterable results table with a summary; settings now
 cover the Panopto credentials as well as the Canvas token
-Faster audits: pooled Canvas connections with retry, concurrent module
 fetching, one shared browser and login for all stages, buffered result writes,
 and no fixed delay between YouTube lookups
-Audits resolve videos from cached module data instead of re-querying Canvas
-Data folders are created automatically on first run
-Unit test suite for the caption classifier and URL handling

0.1.0
-Fully functional individual course audits
-Embedded Video Support, youtube video support
-result summary
-adjustable settings for canvas api key
-requires canvas account with access to courses to audit
-data can be easily reset by the user
